@slug k12-curriculum-development-expert-registration
@title K–12 Curriculum Development Expert Registration Form
@intro The School Expert is building a professional network of experienced education professionals who can contribute to K–12 curriculum development, curriculum review, academic design, assessment, learning resources, teacher development, educational research, and related projects across India.
@intro This form is intended for experienced educators, curriculum specialists, subject matter experts, academic leaders, researchers, instructional designers, assessment specialists, teacher educators, authors, and education professionals with relevant K–12 expertise.
@intro Please provide accurate information and relevant evidence of your professional experience.
