## Declaration
Accuracy* | consent | | I confirm that the information provided in this registration form is accurate and complete to the best of my knowledge.
No commitment* | consent | | I understand that submission of this form does not automatically constitute empanelment, appointment, certification, or a commitment of work by The School Expert.
Review authorisation* | consent | | I authorize The School Expert to review the information and supporting documents provided for the purpose of assessing my professional profile and suitability for relevant education and curriculum development assignments.
